          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Retina 分辨率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runtime bundles combine Wine with a graphics layer. Jadeite and the Steam shim are separate compatibility components. Each version is kept on its own, so an update never breaks a working one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行环境包将 Wine 与图形层组合在一起。Jadeite 和 Steam 兼容层是独立的兼容性组件。每个版本单独保存，更新不会破坏可用的旧版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
