    },
    "While %@ was running, it made a new copy of a file MacGacha had set aside. The game folder keeps the new file. The older copy is in a recovery folder, so nothing was lost." : {
      "comment" : "The argument is the game's name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 运行期间，为 MacGacha 已移开的一个文件新建了副本。游戏文件夹保留新文件，旧副本保存在恢复文件夹中，没有丢失任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workarounds %@ needs to start on a Mac, such as a small helper that starts the game. They don't change the game's files. With patches off, the game usually doesn't start." : {
      "comment" : "The argument is the game's name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 在 Mac 上启动所需的变通方案，例如一个用于启动游戏的小型辅助程序。它们不会修改游戏文件。关闭补丁后，游戏通常无法启动。"
          }
        }
      }
